  "title": "IACKD: Intention Action Conflict EEG-Hand Kinematics Dataset ",
  "description": "This dataset comprises EEG and hand kinematics data recorded during an intention-action conflict paradigm, in which participants performed hand movements while cognitive intention and executed action were experimentally manipulated. The data are intended to support research into the neural and behavioral correlates of intention-action conflict. Data were organized into BIDS format for public sharing and analysis.",
